# PlannerVids is a separate, isolated app (its own package.json, lockfile,
# Next.js build) living at plannervids/. It is not part of the PREUVIA
# DUERP Vercel project and must never be uploaded/considered by its
# deployments — a second lockfile/Next.js app at the repo root otherwise
# confuses Vercel's zero-config framework/monorepo detection for this
# project. PlannerVids will get its own deployment target when it's ready.
plannervids
